aised, she makes a sulky face."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Even if she is happy inside, she has trouble showing it on her face."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her younger brother is in and out of the hospital due to an incurable disease."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A drug that can cure her brother's illness has been approved overseas, but has not yet been approved in Japan."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She wants to have her brother treated at a hospital overseas, but it would cost a huge amount of money, so she decides to leave the school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from DL site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c130757"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/96/96a6245d53dbc8e9f38ed065463c0160fe1bc203c3708e40cf14e776f134601e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fe135117da3f94557433de269d178dcd8cf54a4533aa8dc656c2ad4a9687e7ff.webp","width":216,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"手塚 りょうこ","creatorId":"vndb:s646","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s646","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s646","name":"立石 めぐみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96218","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c130758","characterName":"武田康太","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c130758"},"originalCharacterName":"武田康太","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c132093","characterName":"春日谷 沙織","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c132093"},"originalCharacterName":"春日谷 沙織","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A teacher at the school the protagonist and Asuna attend."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has known Asuna since she was a child, so she thinks of her as a younger sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Former delinquent."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She had a rough school days, and after graduation she was a part-time worker for a while, but then she made up her mind to go to university and become a teacher."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She went to university later than her classmates, so she doesn't have many years as a teacher."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from DL site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c132093"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/25f9f612ab2dfe5684833c69387e93ff4d796f01b4400cf3b16bdaac52c546e0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/56/560d82012efb64d4c0881d105ae9e7f1bfa77f51042acbfcfa67ab9cab4f9c95.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"かぐや 凛子","creatorId":"vndb:s4309","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4309","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4309","name":"かぐや 凛子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96219","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:1036","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:1036","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:1036","name":"LiLiTH","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-brand:35233:1036","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p149","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p149","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p149","name":"LILITH｜リリス","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:124294:v47389","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p149","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p149","canonicalEnt